  "version": "0.19.3",
  "notes": "## 0.19.3 - 2026-08-30\n\n### Features\n\n- Add Japanese language support throughout the desktop app and tray menu\n- Add an option on Windows and Linux to use the system title bar and window controls\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Make long links easier to read and open in clipboard previews (#1411)\n- Prevent visual artifacts when switching pages or toggling settings (#1414)\n- Restore support for macOS Monterey 12.5 and later (#1431)\n- Prevent temporary port conflicts from stopping the app during startup (#1474)\n- Show a clear fallback instead of failing when a text preview is unavailable (#1556)\n- Keep the history list at a readable width on wide screens (#1582)\n- Keep the app connected to its local background service when a system proxy is configured\n- Improve Linux window rendering and prevent AppImage startup failures on affected systems\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.19.3 - 2026-08-30\n\n### Features\n\n- 桌面应用和托盘菜单现已支持日语\n- Windows 和 Linux 现可选择使用系统标题栏和窗口控件\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 优化剪贴板链接预览，使较长链接更易阅读和打开 (#1411)\n- 修复切换页面或开关设置时出现的画面残影 (#1414)\n- 恢复对 macOS Monterey 12.5 及更高版本的支持 (#1431)\n- 修复临时端口冲突导致应用启动失败的问题 (#1474)\n- 修复文本预览不可用时无法正常显示的问题，并提供明确提示 (#1556)\n- 限制宽屏下的历史记录列表宽度，使内容更易阅读 (#1582)\n- 修复配置系统代理后应用无法连接本地后台服务的问题\n- 改善 Linux 窗口显示，并修复部分环境下 AppImage 无法启动的问题",
